V-1049: V-1049 accepted. The platform-created untracked .orchestra/private symlink is now filtered out of the WIP, kill, merge, switch and delete clean checks, but only when it points at this repository's shared private dir. User files and tracked or staged changes stay visible. Host full suite with the hub env unset: 5497 passed and 1 failed. The single failure was a broken backtick path in AGENTS.md that I had introduced in main; it is fixed in cf5987e2f and unrelated to this diff. The root cause of the original incident is still unconfirmed, as the report says. I reviewed the diff myself; no model review was requested. A restart is needed, and the idle watcher will do it.

